</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle" align = "center">
<ptxt>
Approx. 0.78 k&#937;
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Using ohmmeter, measure resistance between terminal “4” and terminal “5”.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If check result is not as specified, replace temperature control actuator (2).
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Temperature control actuator resistance (Total resistance)
</title>
<ptxt>
6 k&#937;
</ptxt>
